---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="We Do Not Sell Personal Information | Great Gus Productions"
  description="Learn how Great Gus Productions handles personal information and why we do not sell personal data."
>
  <section class="legal-page">
    <h1>We Do Not Sell Personal Information</h1>
    <p class="last-updated">Last Updated: March 9, 2026</p>

    <div class="legal-content">
      <h2>Our Approach</h2>
<p>
GREAT GUS PRODUCTIONS LLC aims to collect as little personal information as reasonably possible.
We only collect limited information when it is needed to operate the website, respond to a message,
process an order, or provide access to services you request.
</p>

<h2>Limited Information Only</h2>
<p>
Depending on how you use the website, the limited information we may receive can include details you
choose to provide such as your name, email address, message content, shipping information, and order-related details.
We may also receive limited technical information that is necessary for the normal operation of the website
or for essential third-party services such as payment processing, order fulfillment, or streaming access.
</p>

<h2>We Do Not Sell or Give Away Personal Information</h2>
<p>
GREAT GUS PRODUCTIONS LLC does not sell personal information. We do not rent it, trade it,
or give it away to advertisers, data brokers, or marketing platforms for their own use.
</p>
<p>
Whatever limited information we do receive is used only for legitimate business purposes such as responding to you,
processing a purchase, fulfilling an order, providing access to a service you requested, maintaining site functionality,
or complying with legal obligations.
</p>

<h2>No Opt-Out Button Is Needed</h2>
<p>
Because we do not sell personal information, there is no separate opt-out button, toggle, or request form required
to stop a sale from happening. There is nothing you need to click to opt out of the sale of your information,
because GREAT GUS PRODUCTIONS LLC does not sell your information in the first place.
</p>

<h2>Why This Notice Exists</h2>
<p>
This page exists for clarity and transparency. If you see a link labeled
<strong>“We Do Not Sell Personal Information,”</strong>
it means exactly that: we collect as little information as we reasonably can, and whatever limited information we do receive
is not sold or given away for monetary or commercial gain.
</p>

<h2>Questions</h2>
<p>
If you have questions about this notice or about how limited information may be handled when you contact us,
place an order, or use related services, you may reach out using the contact information below.
</p>

<h2>Contact</h2>
<p>
GREAT GUS PRODUCTIONS LLC<br />
Washington State<br />
<a href="mailto:greatgusproductions@gmail.com">
greatgusproductions@gmail.com
</a>
</p>

<h2>Copyright</h2>
<p>
© 2018–2026 GREAT GUS PRODUCTIONS LLC. All Rights Reserved.
</p>

    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal-page {
    max-width: 820px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 4rem 1rem 6rem;
  }

  .legal-page h1 {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    font-size: 2.4rem;
    font-weight: 300;
  }

  .last-updated {
    margin-top: -2rem;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    text-align: left;
    color: #bdbdbd;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  .legal-content h2 {
    color: var(--accent);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .legal-content p,
  .legal-content li {
    color: #e6e6e6;
    line-height: 1.7;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  .legal-content ul {
    padding-left: 1.2rem;
  }
</style>
